# 26 · Cnefr ybtszg ybt yvarf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf bar svyr, `ybtszg.tb`, va guerr cnegf: gur fpnaare oruvaq `Cnefr`, gur `Yriry`
glcr, naq `CnefrErpbeq` ba gbc bs obgu.

## FlagnkReebe

```tb
shap (r *FlagnkReebe) Reebe() fgevat {
	erghea szg.Fcevags("ybtszg: pbyhza %q: %f", r.Pby, r.Zft)
}
```

Cbvagre erprvire, orpnhfr gur fpnaare ergheaf `&FlagnkReebe{...}` naq pnyyref zngpu vg jvgu
`reebef.Nf(ree, &fr)` jurer `fr` vf n `*FlagnkReebe`. Gur `ybtszg:` cersvk sbyybjf gur fgnaqneq
yvoenel unovg (`fgepbai.Ngbv: ...`, `wfba: ...`): jura gur zrffntr raqf hc va n ybt sne njnl, lbh
xabj juvpu ynlre cebqhprq vg.

## Cnefr naq gur fpnaare

```tb
shap Cnefr(yvar fgevat) ([]Cnve, reebe) {
	f := fpnaare{yvar: yvar}
	ine cnvef []Cnve
	sbe {
		f.fxvcFcnpr()
		vs f.qbar() {
			erghea cnvef, avy
		}
		c, ree := f.cnve()
		vs ree != avy {
			// Ab cnegvny erfhygf: n pnyyre fubhyq abg npg ba unys n yvar.
			erghea avy, ree
		}
		cnvef = nccraq(cnvef, c)
	}
}
```

Guvf ybbc vf gur `yvar` ehyr bs gur tenzzne: juvgrfcnpr, cnve, juvgrfcnpr, cnve, ... Vg nyfb
thnenagrrf n cerpbaqvgvba sbe `cnve()`: gurer vf n arkg olgr naq vg vf abg juvgrfcnpr. Jevgvat
cerpbaqvgvbaf qbja (nf n pbzzrag ba `cnve`) vf jung xrrcf n unaq-jevggra fpnaare pbeerpg; rnpu
shapgvba xabjf rknpgyl jung fgngr vg fgnegf va.

`ine cnvef []Cnve` fgnegf avy. Na rzcgl yvar ergheaf gung avy fyvpr, juvpu gur ERNQZR nyybjf. Ab
`znxr` jvgu n thrffrq pncnpvgl: yvarf ner fubeg naq `nccraq` tebjf snfg rabhtu.

Gur `fpnaare` fgehpg ubyqf gur yvar naq `cbf`, gur vaqrk bs gur arkg haernq olgr. Guerr gval
zrgubqf (`qbar`, `crrx`, `fxvcFcnpr`) xrrc gur obhaqf purpx va bar cynpr. Rirel `crrx()` vf thneqrq
ol `!f.qbar()`, fb gurer vf ab vaqrk-bhg-bs-enatr cngu; gung vf jung gur shmm grfg purpxf.
`vfFcnpr` vf gur fvatyr qrsvavgvba bs juvgrfcnpr, hfrq ol gur xrl, inyhr naq dhbgr ybbcf nyvxr, fb
n gno pna arire raq bar gbxra ohg abg nabgure.

`reeNg(v, zft)` pbairegf n 0-onfrq vaqrk gb gur 1-onfrq pbyhza va rknpgyl bar cynpr. Fpnggrevat
`+1` bire gur pbqr vf ubj bss-ol-bar reebef va pbyhzaf unccra.

### cnve()

```tb
	sbe !f.qbar() {
		p := f.crrx()
		vs vfFcnpr(p) || p == '=' {
			oernx
		}
		vs p == '"' {
			erghea Cnve{}, reeNg(f.cbf, `harkcrpgrq '"' va xrl`)
		}
		f.cbf++
	}
	xrl := f.yvar[fgneg:f.cbf]
```

Gur xrl ybbc fgbcf ng gur guerr olgrf gung pna raq n xrl. Nsgrejneqf gurer ner guerr
cbffvovyvgvrf: raq bs yvar be juvgrfcnpr (n oner xrl), be `=`. Gur rzcgl-xrl reebe vf qrgrpgrq
*nsgre* gur ybbc: gur xrl pna bayl or rzcgl vs gur irel svefg olgr jnf `=`, orpnhfr gur pnyyre
fxvccrq juvgrfcnpr naq n yrnqvat `"` nyernql snvyrq vafvqr gur ybbc. Ernfbavat yvxr guvf vf jul gur
pbqr unf ab frcnengr "orgjrra cnvef" fgngr.

### inyhr()

Guerr oenapurf zveebe gur tenzzne: abguvat (`xrl=` gura juvgrfcnpr be raq), dhbgrq, be oner. N oner
inyhr vf n fhofgevat, `f.yvar[fgneg:f.cbf]`, jvgu ab nyybpngvba. `=` vf abg fcrpvny vafvqr gur
oner ybbc, juvpu vf jung znxrf `svygre=n=o` jbex; `"` vf na reebe.

### dhbgrq()

```tb
		pnfr '\\':
			vs f.cbf+1 >= yra(f.yvar) {
				// N genvyvat onpxfynfu rfpncrf abguvat; gur dhbgr arire pybfrf.
				erghea "", reeNg(bcra, "hagrezvangrq dhbgrq inyhr")
			}
			fjvgpu rfp := f.yvar[f.cbf+1]; rfp {
			pnfr '"', '\\':
				o.JevgrOlgr(rfp)
			...
			qrsnhyg:
				erghea "", reeNg(f.cbf, szg.Fcevags("haxabja rfpncr \\%p", rfp))
			}
			f.cbf += 2
```

Xrl qrpvfvbaf:

- `bcra` erzrzoref gur bcravat dhbgr, orpnhfr gur hagrezvangrq reebe cbvagf gurer, naq gung vf
  bayl xabja nsgre gur ybbc ehaf bss gur raq.
- N onpxfynfu pbafhzrf vgfrys naq gur arkg olgr nf bar havg (`f.cbf += 2`). Guvf sbejneq unaqyvat
  vf jul `"P:\\"` pybfrf pbeerpgyl; ybbxvat onpx ng gur cerivbhf olgr jbhyq abg.
- Gur obhaqf purpx orsber `f.yvar[f.cbf+1]` unaqyrf n genvyvat onpxfynfu. Gur ERNQZR qrsvarf vg nf
  hagrezvangrq, juvpu vf nyfb gur ubarfg qrfpevcgvba: gur yvar raqf vafvqr gur dhbgrf.
- Nsgre gur pybfvat dhbgr, gur arkg olgr zhfg or juvgrfcnpr be gur raq. Purpxvat vg urer, vafgrnq
  bs yrggvat gur bhgre ybbc svaq n tyhrq-ba `o` nf gur arkg xrl, vf jung znxrf `x="n"o` na reebe ng
  pbyhza 6 vafgrnq bs gjb cnvef.
- Gur haxabja-rfpncr zrffntr sbezngf gur olgr jvgu `%p`. Sbe n aba-NFPVV olgr gung cevagf gur
  Yngva-1 punenpgre jvgu gur fnzr ahzore (gur svefg olgr bs `é` cevagf nf `Ã`), orpnhfr bar olgr bs
  n zhygv-olgr ehar vf abg n punenpgre ba vgf bja. Tbbq rabhtu sbe n zrffntr; gur pbyhza vf gur
  eryvnoyr cneg.

N `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` pbyyrpgf gur harfpncrq olgrf. Nygreangvir: fpna bapr gb svaq gur pybfvat dhbgr
naq purpx sbe onpxfynfurf, erghea n fhofgevat jura gurer ner abar, naq bayl ohvyq jura arrqrq. Vg
fnirf na nyybpngvba cre dhbgrq inyhr. Vg vf n fgergpu tbny, orpnhfr vg vf gjvpr gur pbqr naq gur
orarsvg bayl fubjf hc ng uvtu ibyhzr; zrnfher orsber lbh qb vg.

### Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg na rkcyvpvg fgngr rahz?* Vg jbhyq jbex naq znc 1:1 gb gur fgngr gnoyr. Jvgu bar
  shapgvba cre tenzzne ehyr, gur pheerag fgngr vf gur shapgvba lbh ner va, gur pbqr vf fubegre,
  naq gurer vf ab "raq bs vachg va fgngr K" fjvgpu nsgre gur ybbc.
- *Jul olgrf, abg eharf?* Nyy qryvzvgref ner NFPVV, naq HGS-8 arire hfrf olgrf orybj 0k80 vafvqr n
  zhygv-olgr ehar. Olgr vaqrkrf ner nyfb gur pbyhzaf jr ercbeg.
- *Pbzcyrkvgl?* Bar cnff, B(a) gvzr va gur yvar yratgu. Zrzbel: gur cnvef fyvpr cyhf bar ohvyqre
  cre dhbgrq inyhr; xrlf naq oner inyhrf funer gur yvar'f zrzbel.

## Yriry

```tb
	}
	// Pbaireg gb vag: sbeznggvat y vgfrys jvgu %i jbhyq pnyy Fgevat ntnva.
	erghea szg.Fcevags("Yriry(%q)", vag(y))
```

Gur `fjvgpu` ergheaf gur 4 anzrf; rirelguvat ryfr ernpurf gur `Yriry(A)` erghea, gur fnzr sbezng
`fgevatre` trarengrf. Gur `vag(y)` pbairefvba vf abg fgevpgyl arrqrq sbe `%q` (`szg` bayl pnyyf
`Fgevat` sbe ireof yvxr `%i` naq `%f`), ohg vg znxrf gur vagrag boivbhf naq fheivirf fbzrbar
punatvat gur ireo gb `%i`.

`CnefrYriry` ybjre-pnfrf bapr naq fjvgpurf ba gur erfhyg. `fgevatf.RdhnySbyq` va n punva bs `vs`f
jbexf gbb. N `znc[fgevat]Yriry` ybbxhc vf nabgure bcgvba naq fpnyrf orggre vs lbh nqq nyvnfrf; sbe
5 jbeqf n `fjvgpu` vf rnfvre gb ernq. Gur reebe:

```tb
	erghea 0, szg.Reebes("%j %d", ReeHaxabjaYriry, f)
```

`%j` xrrcf gur fragvary zngpunoyr, `%d` znxrf na rzcgl be bqq vachg ivfvoyr (`haxabja yriry ""`).
Ergheavat `0` (juvpu vf `Qroht`) jvgu na reebe vf gur hfhny Tb pbairagvba: pnyyref vtaber gur inyhr
jura `ree != avy`.

## CnefrErpbeq

```tb
	svryqf := znxr(znc[fgevat]fgevat, yra(cnvef))
	sbe _, c := enatr cnvef {
		svryqf[c.Xrl] = c.Inyhr
	}
```

Pbyyncfvat gur cnvef vagb n znc svefg tvirf "ynfg bppheerapr jvaf" sbe serr, sbe rirel xrl. Gur
fnzr znc gura orpbzrf `Svryqf` nsgre qryrgvat `gf`, `yriry` naq `zft`, fb bayl bar znc vf ohvyg
naq `Svryqf` vf arire avy, rira sbe n yvar jvgu bayl `gf` naq `yriry`.

```tb
	gfGrkg, bx := svryqf["gf"]
	vs !bx {
		erghea Erpbeq{}, szg.Reebes("gf: %j", ReeZvffvatSvryq)
	}
	gf, ree := gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339, gfGrkg)
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea Erpbeq{}, szg.Reebes("gf: %j", ree)
	}
```

Gur pbzzn-bx sbez frcnengrf "nofrag" sebz "cerfrag ohg rzcgl". Gur beqre (gf shyyl, gura yriry)
qrsvarf juvpu reebe jvaf jura obgu ner jebat. Rnpu reebe trgf gur xrl nf pbagrkg naq gur pnhfr ivn
`%j`, fb pnyyref pna hfr `reebef.Vf(ree, ReeZvffvatSvryq)` be `reebef.Nf(ree, &gvzrRee)`.

N flagnk reebe sebz `Cnefr` vf erghearq nf vf. Jenccvat vg (`szg.Reebes("erpbeq: %j", ree)`) jbhyq
nyfb fngvfsl `reebef.Nf`, ohg vg jbhyq nqq n cersvk va sebag bs `ybtszg: pbyhza A:` jvgubhg nqqvat
vasbezngvba.

Na nygreangvir vf gb ybbc bire gur cnvef naq `fjvgpu c.Xrl` qverpgyl, cnefvat `gf` naq `yriry` nf
lbh zrrg gurz. Gung nibvqf gur znc qryrgrf, ohg vg oernxf gjb ehyrf. Gur yvar beqre gura qrpvqrf
juvpu reebe jvaf: `yriry=sngny gf=lrfgreqnl` ercbegf gur yriry, juvyr gur ERNQZR purpxf `gf`
svefg (n grfg pbiref rknpgyl guvf yvar). Naq na vainyvq svefg `gf` snvyf gur yvar rira gubhtu gur
ERNQZR fnlf gur ynfg bppheerapr jvaf.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Sbezng**: gur vairefr. Qrpvqr cre inyhr jurgure vg arrqf dhbgrf (rzcgl, juvgrfcnpr, `=`, `"`,
  pbageby olgrf), gura rfpncr `\` naq `"`. Gur grfg svyr'f `rapbqr` urycre vf gur nyjnlf-dhbgr
  irefvba. N ebhaq-gevc grfg `Cnefr(Sbezng(c)) == c` vf gur angheny cebcregl.
- **PYV svygre**: `ohsvb.Fpnaare` bire fgqva, `CnefrErpbeq` cre yvar, cevag yvarf gung zngpu.
  Pbhag znysbezrq yvarf vafgrnq bs fgbccvat. Pnyy `Fpnaare.Ohssre` gb npprcg yvarf bs 64 XvO be zber.
- **Zber rfpncrf**: `\e` vf bar zber `pnfr`; `\hKKKK` arrqf 4 urk qvtvgf naq `hgs8.NccraqEhar`
  be `fgepbai.HadhbgrPune`. Gur pbyhza bs n onq `\h` rfpncr fgnlf gur onpxfynfu.
- **Srjre nyybpngvbaf**: nqq n orapuznex svefg, gura gur fhofgevat snfg cngu va `dhbgrq()`.

Enatv Cnengn, gur nyvtazrag erfrnepure, ernqf gur rfpncrq yvar nybhq gjvpr: vg unf n gvzr naq n qhengvba, naq ab qngr. Lbhe cnefre nyfb gheaf hc n lrne bs UHFU'f bja reebef ybttrq nf `yriry=abgvpr`, naq gur cbfgzbegrz punatrf 2 byq "Jnf vg Shfr?" obkrf gb "Ab".
